node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
.infino/

# Installed harness output, generated from core/ by install/Install-Harness.ps1
# and tracked per-file by .claude/.harness-manifest.json. Committing it would put
# a second copy of core/claude/ beside its source in the same repo, and the two
# drift. Run the installer after cloning to get the hooks and agent defs.
# Anchored to the repo root: unanchored, this would also ignore a `.claude/`
# tree inside a test fixture, and the Pester suite already builds such trees.
/.claude/

# Editor and script backups. change-management.md requires deleting a .bak once
# the change it guards is stable, but nothing enforced that, and an untracked
# install/Export-Account.ps1.bak survived a full pre-push audit sitting one
# `git add .` away from publication -- holding, as it happened, the pre-fix copy
# of a throw message that leaked the operator's profile path. Ignoring them means
# a forgotten backup can no longer become a committed one.
*.bak
*.bak.*

# Per-environment overlay for the account layer. A `.local.md` beside any rule,
# skill or agent file holds one machine's specifics -- named hosts, a service
# inventory, incidents from one person's infrastructure -- so the published
# payload stays usable by someone who is not its author. install/Export-Account.ps1
# skips these on the leaf name at any depth; this entry is the second half, so a
# project that installs the harness cannot commit one either.
*.local.md
